msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod dalam halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Use local testing mode (available with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.22.0 or later) to test programs before fine-tuning them and sending them to real quantum hardware.  After using local testing mode to verify your program, all you need to change is the backend name to run it on a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Gunakan mod ujian tempatan (tersedia dengan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.22.0 atau lebih baru) untuk menguji program sebelum menala-halusnya dan menghantar ke perkakasan kuantum sebenar. Selepas menggunakan mod ujian tempatan untuk mengesahkan program anda, satu-satunya perubahan yang perlu anda lakukan ialah menukar nama backend untuk menjalankannya pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The Executor primitive does not support local testing mode.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Primitif Executor tidak menyokong mod ujian tempatan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use local testing mode, specify one of the fake backends from "
"``qiskit_ibm_runtime.fake_provider`` or specify a Qiskit Aer backend when "
"instantiating a Qiskit Runtime primitive or a session.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan mod ujian tempatan, tentukan salah satu backend palsu "
"daripada ``qiskit_ibm_runtime.fake_provider`` atau tentukan backend Qiskit "
"Aer semasa menginisialisasi primitif Qiskit Runtime atau sesi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Fake backends**: The [fake "
"backends](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider)"
"  in ``qiskit_ibm_runtime.fake_provider`` mimic the behaviors of IBM&reg; "
"QPUs by using QPU snapshots. The QPU snapshots contain important information"
" about the QPU, such as the coupling map, basis gates, and qubit properties,"
" which are useful for testing the transpiler and performing noisy "
"simulations of the QPU. The noise model from the snapshot is automatically "
"applied during simulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Backend palsu**: [Backend palsu](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime/fake-provider) dalam ``qiskit_ibm_runtime.fake_provider`` meniru"
" tingkah laku QPU IBM&reg; dengan menggunakan syot kilat QPU. Syot kilat QPU"
" mengandungi maklumat penting tentang QPU, seperti peta gandingan, get asas,"
" dan sifat qubit, yang berguna untuk menguji transpiler dan melakukan "
"simulasi berbising bagi QPU. Model hingar daripada syot kilat digunakan "
"secara automatik semasa simulasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Aer simulator**: Simulators from [Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-with-"
"qiskit-aer) provide higher-performance simulation that can handle larger "
"circuits and [custom noise models](/guides/build-noise-models). A list of "
"simulation method options are available when you use `AerSimulator` in local"
" testing mode. See the [Clifford simulation mode example](#clifford-sim), "
"which demonstrates how to efficiently simulate Clifford circuits with a "
"large number of qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Simulator Aer**: Simulator daripada [Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-with-"
"qiskit-aer) menyediakan simulasi berprestasi lebih tinggi yang boleh "
"mengendalikan litar yang lebih besar dan [model hingar "
"kustom](/guides/build-noise-models). Senarai pilihan kaedah simulasi "
"tersedia apabila anda menggunakan `AerSimulator` dalam mod ujian tempatan. "
"Lihat [contoh mod simulasi Clifford](#clifford-sim), yang menunjukkan cara "
"mensimulasikan litar Clifford dengan bilangan qubit yang besar secara "
"cekap.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"**List of simulation methods available from Qiskit Aer**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"**Senarai kaedah simulasi yang tersedia daripada Qiskit Aer**\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    See the [`AerSimulator`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.AerSimulator) documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Lihat dokumentasi [`AerSimulator`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.AerSimulator) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"automatic\"``: Default simulation method. Select the simulation method "
"automatically, based on the circuit and noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"automatic\"``: Kaedah simulasi lalai. Pilih kaedah simulasi secara "
"automatik, berdasarkan Circuit dan model hingar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"statevector\"``: A dense statevector simulation that can sample "
"measurement outcomes from *ideal* circuits with all measurements at the end "
"of the circuit. For noisy simulations, each shot samples a randomly sampled "
"noisy circuit from the noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"statevector\"``: Simulasi vektor keadaan padat yang boleh mengambil "
"sampel hasil pengukuran daripada litar *ideal* dengan semua pengukuran di "
"penghujung litar. Untuk simulasi berbising, setiap tembakan mengambil sampel"
" litar berbising secara rawak daripada model hingar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"density_matrix\"``: A density matrix simulation that can sample "
"measurement outcomes from *noisy* circuits with all measurements at the end "
"of the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"density_matrix\"``: Simulasi matriks ketumpatan yang boleh mengambil "
"sampel hasil pengukuran daripada litar *berbising* dengan semua pengukuran "
"di penghujung litar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"stabilizer\"``: An efficient Clifford stabilizer state simulator that "
"can simulate noisy Clifford circuits if all errors in the noise model are "
"also Clifford errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"stabilizer\"``: Simulator keadaan penstabil Clifford yang cekap yang "
"boleh mensimulasikan litar Clifford berbising jika semua ralat dalam model "
"hingar juga merupakan ralat Clifford.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"extended_stabilizer\"``: An approximate simulator for Clifford + T "
"circuits based on decomposing the state into a ranked-stabilizer state. The "
"number of terms grows with the number of non-Clifford (T) gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"extended_stabilizer\"``: Simulator anggaran untuk Circuit Clifford + T "
"berdasarkan penguraian keadaan kepada keadaan penstabil berperingkat. "
"Bilangan sebutan bertambah dengan bilangan get bukan-Clifford (T).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"matrix_product_state\"``: A tensor-network statevector simulator that "
"uses a Matrix Product State (MPS) representation for the state. This can be "
"done with or without truncating the MPS bond dimensions, depending on the "
"simulator options. The default behavior is no truncation.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"matrix_product_state\"``: Simulator vektor keadaan rangkaian tensor yang"
" menggunakan perwakilan Keadaan Hasil Darab Matriks (MPS) untuk keadaan. Ini"
" boleh dilakukan dengan atau tanpa memotong dimensi ikatan MPS, bergantung "
"pada pilihan simulator. Tingkah laku lalai adalah tanpa pemotongan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"unitary\"``: A dense unitary matrix simulation of an ideal circuit. This"
" simulates the unitary matrix of the circuit itself, rather than the "
"evolution of an initial quantum state. This method can only simulate gates; "
"it does not support measurement, reset, or noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"unitary\"``: Simulasi matriks unitari padat bagi litar ideal. Ini "
"mensimulasikan matriks unitari litar itu sendiri, bukan evolusi keadaan "
"kuantum awal. Kaedah ini hanya boleh mensimulasikan get; ia tidak menyokong "
"pengukuran, penetapan semula, atau hingar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``\"superop\"``: A dense superoperator matrix simulation of an ideal or "
"noisy circuit. This simulates the superoperator matrix of the circuit "
"itself, rather than the evolution of an initial quantum state. This method "
"can simulate ideal and noisy gates and resets, but it does not support "
"measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"``\"superop\"``: Simulasi matriks superoperator padat bagi litar ideal atau "
"berbising. Ini mensimulasikan matriks superoperator litar itu sendiri, bukan"
" evolusi keadaan kuantum awal. Kaedah ini boleh mensimulasikan get dan "
"penetapan semula ideal dan berbising, tetapi tidak menyokong pengukuran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    * ``\"tensor_network\"``: A tensor-network-based simulation that supports both statevector and density matrix. Currently this is only available for GPU and is accelerated by using cuQuantum `cuTensorNet` APIs.\n"
"    </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"    * ``\"tensor_network\"``: Simulasi berasaskan rangkaian tensor yang menyokong vektor keadaan dan matriks ketumpatan. Pada masa ini ini hanya tersedia untuk GPU dan dipercepatkan dengan menggunakan API cuQuantum `cuTensorNet`.\n"
"    </AccordionItem>\n"
"    </Accordion>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- You can specify all Qiskit Runtime options in local testing mode.  However, all options except shots are ignored when run on a local simulator.\n"
"- It is recommended that you install Qiskit Aer before using fake backends or Aer simulators by running `pip install qiskit-aer`. The fake backends use Aer simulators under the cover if available, to take advantage of their performance.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"- Anda boleh menentukan semua pilihan Qiskit Runtime dalam mod ujian tempatan. Walau bagaimanapun, semua pilihan kecuali shots diabaikan apabila dijalankan pada simulator tempatan.\n"
"- Adalah disyorkan untuk memasang Qiskit Aer sebelum menggunakan backend palsu atau simulator Aer dengan menjalankan `pip install qiskit-aer`. Backend palsu menggunakan simulator Aer di sebalik tabir jika tersedia, untuk memanfaatkan prestasinya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* If you currently use the Qiskit SDK, you can use the existing Qiskit Aer"
